#: src/Modules/SMTP/Admin/SettingsPage.php:582
msgid ""
"Domain differs from the mailbox login. Most servers will reject or rewrite "
"this — only use with relays that support arbitrary senders."
msgstr ""
"Le domaine diffère de l'identifiant de boîte mail. La plupart des serveurs "
"vont rejeter ou réécrire ceci — à utiliser uniquement avec des relais qui "
"supportent des expéditeurs arbitraires."

#: src/Modules/SMTP/Admin/SettingsPage.php:583
msgid ""
"Local part differs from the mailbox login. Some servers may rewrite the From "
